msgstr "No duel judged yet. Answers will appear here, one by one."

msgid "Ta courbe, bande par bande. Chaque changement s’entend tout de suite ; les duels restent le meilleur moyen de savoir si tu préfères."
msgstr "Your curve, band by band. Every change is heard straight away; duels remain the best way to find out what you prefer."

